==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Golduck}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Triumphant|Golduck|22}} from the {{TCG|Triumphant}} expansion.
*'''Aqua Edge''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Kalos Starter Set|Greninja|14}} from the {{TCG|Kalos Starter Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

